sequenceDiagram
actor Admin as Admin
participant AdminConsole as Boundary: AdminConsole
participant FieldAssignmentControl as Control: FieldAssignmentControl
participant FieldAssignment as Entity: FieldAssignment
Admin->>+AdminConsole: Submit assignment change
AdminConsole->>+FieldAssignmentControl: Validate Admin, field and user
FieldAssignmentControl->>+FieldAssignment: Insert or remove unique assignment
FieldAssignment-->>-FieldAssignmentControl: Return current assignment
FieldAssignmentControl-->>-AdminConsole: Write audit log
AdminConsole-->>-Admin: Refresh access-management view
